# Frontend rules

## Blade first, no SPA layer

Server-rendered Blade with Tailwind, plus small amounts of Alpine or plain JavaScript only where a page genuinely needs interactivity. Do not install Livewire, Inertia, Vue or React, and do not add paid UI kits.

## Interactive screens use a normal request

Preview, dry run and connection tests are ordinary form posts that re-render the page with the result. Reach for JavaScript only after a server-rendered version is genuinely insufficient.
